    <sh:path rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasPaymentArrangement"/>
    <sh:description>Information about financial clauses that will govern some economic aspects of the execution of the contract. Additional Information: These clauses usually refer to financial and payment provisions. This type of information should be structured instead of a free text in order to reuse it an ideal world. Unfortunately this is an information that in the real life no one is willing to provide pro-actively. WG Pending of discussion with eForms</sh:description>
    <sh:or rdf:nodeID="n86e40985fb8245d2a081f3a2d1a0b126b127"/>
