    <rdfs:comment>An agreement between one or more Contracting Authorities and one or more Economic Operators. Additional Information: When a Framework Agreement is concerned, the FA will result from LotAwardOutcome which describes a Lot which specifies the both the Qualification and Award Criteria.</rdfs:comment>
