    <sh:description>The maximum number of lots for which contract(s) can be awarded to one tenderer. Additional information: This field is used to complement the SubmissionTerms (which are at the Lot level) for the Procedure level which is covered by the regulation (EU)-2015-1986 (modeled in the TED Standard Forms).</sh:description>
