    <sh:targetClass rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#Awarder"/>
    <rdfs:comment>A Role of an Agent that signs the Award Decision. Additional information: BT-08 can be Awarding CBP; BG-03 is the Buyer. But Awarding CPB is not the same as the Buyer; the organisations may differ for these roles. Having the Awarder Role allows us to specify which Organisation is involved in the Award Decision.</rdfs:comment>
